The vendored modules under prima_ratio/engine/ (prompts, encoding, prefix,
llamacpp) implement SemIf's direct option-logit decision method: prompt
contract, single-token answer-slot verification, shared-state prefix reuse and
the llama.cpp scoring backend. Divergences from upstream (Torch/MLX paths
removed; opt-in GPU offload, KV-cache type and window-sized SWA cache;
chat/vision/calibration layers) are listed in VENDORED.md.

prima-ratio is an independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by
SemIf, TypeSafe or Jev.
